#. settings-schema.json->applet-description->description
msgid ""
"YASM displays live system metrics directly in your Cinnamon panel — uptime, "
"load average, battery charge and power draw, CPU and GPU temperature and "
"usage, memory, disk utilisation and throughput, network transfer rates, and "
"fan speeds.\n"
"\n"
"Each tile shows a compact sparkline history graph on hover. Metrics are "
"collected every few seconds and thresholds can be configured per tile to "
"colour-code warn and alert states."
msgstr ""

